  "notes": [
    "One physical bulb per named matrix address follows factory lamp matrix, lamp boards and individual socket assemblies; mesh/light flags never supply quantities. Seven backbox bulbs 2..8 are separate cabinet records.",
    "Most ordinary original lights are bulb-configured, mesh suppressed. They are retained as single bulb locations after physical socket/PCB correspondence, not because a lone glow establishes a socket. Some stock sites are occluded; no exhaustive optical calibration claimed.",
    "Six actual Bigus jet bulbs agree exactly with original centers; larger 4K bumper glow helpers are excluded.",
    "39/40 old l39/l40 colored cover centers are replaced by script-bound 4K own BulbLeft/Right glass-mesh centers; original cover discrepancy is a consumed-artifact approximation, not unresolved physical disagreement.",
    "4K insert helpers for 43/44/46 and its L55 lighting helper have different centers; they are not independently modeled physical bulbs and cannot overrule original physically corroborated socket positions."
  ],
